        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni iri oó', «Aakooeé' aníng miwa ló'wa i buúhh, kuúng mukwí u xú' adór tar múk amohhoó' tlakweema tlehhtuuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín án ina bayé', ‹Munguiirén tleehhang awa atén ti geerahará', asma heewí ta bay Mose, kudá' geeraawo atén taa duux baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ale, gár gwa sleer a xuaanaaká.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inooín ngiri báw, ‹Umuúqo heewo oo sahaábu gu koóm ngu haniisi.› Naagáy ngway hanisiyé', aníng nguri baraá ásltí kwaáhh, damaárí niri baraadá' wa ti'ít.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Mose ngiwa qo ár adór mukwí ira dee/anuút, asma Aroni muu gwa máy iwa dee/aanuuti adoodá' i slaiya' ngiwa tlehhiitiya', tiri kilooín mureekeesáy huwiyé' dír wakuuser'ine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose iri sihhiít afkú xafi, iri oó', «Umuúqo heewo oo bartá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i diriia ni amor'eé' waaraahhi.» Múk tlahhoó Laáwi sleémeero iri amoorós i waaraáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giri báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Israeli i kaahi, ‹Umuúqo heewo paángarós ngi taataahhi, umuú heewo afkú xafi ngur waaraahhi baraá xafaywihe, umuúqo heewo hhiyaawós ngu gaasi, nee mulqumoowós ngu gaasi, nee inslaawmoowós ngu gaasi.› » ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee mukwí oo tlahhoó Laáwi adoodá' Mose aa oó' ngiri tleehhiyé', nee múk aa qaatl baalaadae a kume tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose iri oó', «Kuungá' laarí taa kiloohúng hanisé' as gadiyér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kawa tlehha', asma aga babaqaasi'iiká na/iihúng kiwa tsu/a', laqaá hhaeehúng, gawaá adoorihe tsuuqaá Mungú iga sleeré'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
