            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Umuúqo heé aníng iga tlakweemaá i tleehh, an kudá' aníng ni fiits baraá kitaábuueene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hám daxta, tláw, muu geerahareek ay didaádá' aníng kangós naa kuúng báw. Ga/aaweek, malaykamooeé' geeraawók gi haar. Tam adoorihe bál aníng birna amorhúng káw, li/aay u buú' as tlakweemaaín.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
